[[:db/add "4c1c75b8-e26c-5124-9d8e-2b0c7d538071" :answer/id #uuid "4c1c75b8-e26c-5124-9d8e-2b0c7d538071"] [:db/add "4c1c75b8-e26c-5124-9d8e-2b0c7d538071" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4c1c75b8-e26c-5124-9d8e-2b0c7d538071" :answer/value "4 \\cdot 2^{- 3 x^{3} + 2 x} \\left(2 - 9 x^{2}\\right) \\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "4c1c75b8-e26c-5124-9d8e-2b0c7d538071" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ad146e83-d809-55d5-b5d2-7a4807735ed5" :answer-field/id #uuid "ad146e83-d809-55d5-b5d2-7a4807735ed5"] [:db/add "ad146e83-d809-55d5-b5d2-7a4807735ed5" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "ad146e83-d809-55d5-b5d2-7a4807735ed5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "ad146e83-d809-55d5-b5d2-7a4807735ed5" :answer-field/choices "4c1c75b8-e26c-5124-9d8e-2b0c7d538071"] [:db/add "ad146e83-d809-55d5-b5d2-7a4807735ed5" :answer-field/correct "4c1c75b8-e26c-5124-9d8e-2b0c7d538071"] [:db/ensure "ad146e83-d809-55d5-b5d2-7a4807735ed5" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "11669aef-a5f9-5388-a104-0a436ef45585" :question/id #uuid "11669aef-a5f9-5388-a104-0a436ef45585"] [:db/add "11669aef-a5f9-5388-a104-0a436ef45585" :question/problem "Given that $y=4\\cdot {2}^{2x-3{x}^{3}}$, find $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}$.\n\n$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}=$\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "11669aef-a5f9-5388-a104-0a436ef45585" :question/worked-solution "First, we express $y$ as the composite function\n\n$$\ny=4\\cdot {2}^{u},\\,u=2x-3{x}^{3}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}u}=4\\cdot {2}^{u}\\ln(2),\\,\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2-9{x}^{2}.\n$$\n\nWe now apply the chain rule and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x} & =\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x} \\\\ & =4\\cdot {2}^{u}\\ln(2)\\cdot (2-9{x}^{2}) \\\\ & =(2-9{x}^{2})\\cdot 4\\cdot {2}^{u}\\ln(2) \\\\ & =(8-36{x}^{2})\\cdot {2}^{2x-3{x}^{3}}\\ln(2).\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "11669aef-a5f9-5388-a104-0a436ef45585" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "11669aef-a5f9-5388-a104-0a436ef45585" :question/answer-fields "ad146e83-d809-55d5-b5d2-7a4807735ed5"] [:db/ensure "11669aef-a5f9-5388-a104-0a436ef45585" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186092261 :knowledge-point/questions "11669aef-a5f9-5388-a104-0a436ef45585"] [:db/add "841e2942-bfa2-5b85-b44b-5fcecbbf51ae" :answer/id #uuid "841e2942-bfa2-5b85-b44b-5fcecbbf51ae"] [:db/add "841e2942-bfa2-5b85-b44b-5fcecbbf51ae" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "841e2942-bfa2-5b85-b44b-5fcecbbf51ae" :answer/value "- 6 \\cdot 6^{- 2 x^{3} - 4} x^{2} \\ln{\\left(6 \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "841e2942-bfa2-5b85-b44b-5fcecbbf51ae" :answer/validate] [:db/add "05032cba-eb6d-54e4-9bd4-90a4529fda64" :answer-field/id #uuid "05032cba-eb6d-54e4-9bd4-90a4529fda64"] [:db/add "05032cba-eb6d-54e4-9bd4-90a4529fda64" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "05032cba-eb6d-54e4-9bd4-90a4529fda64" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "05032cba-eb6d-54e4-9bd4-90a4529fda64" :answer-field/choices "841e2942-bfa2-5b85-b44b-5fcecbbf51ae"] [:db/add "05032cba-eb6d-54e4-9bd4-90a4529fda64" :answer-field/correct "841e2942-bfa2-5b85-b44b-5fcecbbf51ae"] [:db/ensure "05032cba-eb6d-54e4-9bd4-90a4529fda64" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "0b8b61b6-6058-58ee-b489-5e87a3738e1a" :question/id #uuid "0b8b61b6-6058-58ee-b489-5e87a3738e1a"] [:db/add "0b8b61b6-6058-58ee-b489-5e87a3738e1a" :question/problem "If $f(x)={6}^{-4-2{x}^{3}}$, find ${f}^{\\prime}(x)$.\n\n$f^{\\prime}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/add "0b8b61b6-6058-58ee-b489-5e87a3738e1a" :question/worked-solution "First, we express $f$ as the composite function\n\n$$\nf={6}^{u},\\,u=-4-2{x}^{3}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}f}{\\mathrm{d}u}={6}^{u}\\ln(6),\\,\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-6{x}^{2}.\n$$\n\nWe now apply the chain rule and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\mathrm{d}f}{\\mathrm{d}x} & =\\frac{\\mathrm{d}f}{\\mathrm{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x} \\\\ & ={6}^{u}\\ln(6)\\cdot (-6{x}^{2}) \\\\ & =(-6{x}^{2})\\cdot {6}^{u}\\ln(6) \\\\ & =-6{x}^{2}\\cdot {6}^{-4-2{x}^{3}}\\ln(6).\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "0b8b61b6-6058-58ee-b489-5e87a3738e1a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "0b8b61b6-6058-58ee-b489-5e87a3738e1a" :question/answer-fields "05032cba-eb6d-54e4-9bd4-90a4529fda64"] [:db/ensure "0b8b61b6-6058-58ee-b489-5e87a3738e1a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186092261 :knowledge-point/questions "0b8b61b6-6058-58ee-b489-5e87a3738e1a"] [:db/add "92a466b7-1343-5de6-93ed-81dc8eaae4cc" :answer/id #uuid "92a466b7-1343-5de6-93ed-81dc8eaae4cc"] [:db/add "92a466b7-1343-5de6-93ed-81dc8eaae4cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "92a466b7-1343-5de6-93ed-81dc8eaae4cc" :answer/value "-9\\cdot 3^{- 4 x}\\ln(3)"] [:db/ensure "92a466b7-1343-5de6-93ed-81dc8eaae4cc" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9fb0deac-7b1c-574a-8c8d-c13074ff7589" :answer/id #uuid "9fb0deac-7b1c-574a-8c8d-c13074ff7589"] [:db/add "9fb0deac-7b1c-574a-8c8d-c13074ff7589" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9fb0deac-7b1c-574a-8c8d-c13074ff7589" :answer/value "-4\\cdot 3^{- 4 x}\\ln(3)"] [:db/ensure "9fb0deac-7b1c-574a-8c8d-c13074ff7589" :answer/validate] [:db/add "be75eec8-65d0-5bd5-a24a-080e621f031b" :answer/id #uuid "be75eec8-65d0-5bd5-a24a-080e621f031b"] [:db/add "be75eec8-65d0-5bd5-a24a-080e621f031b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "be75eec8-65d0-5bd5-a24a-080e621f031b" :answer/value "-6\\cdot 3^{- 4 x}\\ln(3)"] [:db/ensure "be75eec8-65d0-5bd5-a24a-080e621f031b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c8f64b24-5080-5a4a-b39c-7931a40f9db8" :answer/id #uuid "c8f64b24-5080-5a4a-b39c-7931a40f9db8"] [:db/add "c8f64b24-5080-5a4a-b39c-7931a40f9db8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c8f64b24-5080-5a4a-b39c-7931a40f9db8" :answer/value "4\\cdot 3^{- 4 x}\\ln(3)"] [:db/ensure "c8f64b24-5080-5a4a-b39c-7931a40f9db8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0904557f-31ec-5d61-be02-e94f759e9131" :answer/id #uuid "0904557f-31ec-5d6